STEP 1 – STANZA ANALYSIS
====================================================

Analyze the sentence exactly as Stanza would.
The Stanza linguistic analysis is assumed to be already available.

The model MUST use the extracted Stanza features to derive the DAGC-ATS representation.

After generating the representation, it MUST explicitly output the grammatical error feature space used in the FPC calculation.
The Dependency Relation must be copied exactly as returned by Stanza.

Do NOT assume any dependency relation.

Do NOT assign fixed dependency labels such as root, nsubj, obj, amod, obl, or any other relation.

Always use the exact Dependency Relation produced by Stanza for the analyzed sentence.

Never infer, predict, or modify linguistic features manually.

