STEP 4 – FUNDAMENTAL PRINCIPLE OF COUNTING (FPC)
====================================================

For every word calculate

Word_Error_Possibilities

=

Gender_F × Number_F × Case_F × Def_F

If one or more features are unavailable,

their Freedom value is 1.

Examples

VERB

Gender_F = 1

Number_F = 1

Case_F = 1

Def_F = 1

Word_Error_Possibilities = 1

Then calculate

Sentence_Error_Possibilities

=

Product of all Word_Error_Possibilities.
Each representation must be returned as one single string separated by spaces.

Example

NOUN Nom Def Sing root

PRON PronType=Prs Nom Sing nsubj

ADP Prep case NOUN obl
